{"name": "HeadHunters", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">HeadHunters is a chaotic <strong>couch/online party game</strong> where you don\u2019t pick a character\u2026 you are the head. Attach to different bodies to gain new weapons and abilities, and adapt on the fly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Improvise. Adapt. Overcome.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to 4 players (1v1, 2v2, free for all). <strong>Fully cross-platform</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can even play with your friends without them owning the game using <strong>Steam Remote Play Together.</strong> They can jump in instantly or try the demo with you for free to test the game, making it easy to experience what HeadHunters is all about\u2026 a game that truly shines when played with friends and is ridiculously fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675690/extras/067f8918cb5882de6beae9c22e594968.poster.avif?t=1779444612\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675690/extras/067f8918cb5882de6beae9c22e594968.webm?t=1779444612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675690/extras/067f8918cb5882de6beae9c22e594968.mp4?t=1779444612\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675690/extras/69f017b13047bf7c005c26e977b03bdf.poster.avif?t=1779444612\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i